              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Inera kwanata EJAKAIT loka ajoresio ebe:” Sirikiirasi akiro nuka inabin kaluedwarete; isisianakinete yes aamameak: inerasi nuepote kotauonokec, kwabo mere nuepote kaituk naka EJAKAIT. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.23.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.23.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
