              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "8",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Mam bobo ilimunete nuka ‘abwokon naka EJAKAIT’: naarai abwokon ŋes akirot naka ŋinituŋanan ilopet; naarai itirioto akiro nuka Edeke lokajaran, nuka EJAKAIT loka ajoresio, Edekewok. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.23.36",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.23.36"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "37",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 23:37"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "37",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ilimokini kwanata enabi ebe, ‘Biai bo kibonok EJAKAIT? ‘ido’ Biai bo atema EJAKAIT?’ ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.23.37",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.23.37"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "38",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 23:38"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "38",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Konye arai itemarete atiar, ‘Abwokon naka EJAKAIT’; kanuka ŋun ŋes inerar EJAKAIT kwanata ebe, ‘Naarai inerasi akirot na ebe, “Abwokon naka EJAKAIT”, ido kejukak yes ebe, “Siribalas, Abwokon naka EJAKAIT.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.23.38",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.23.38"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "39",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 23:39"
          },
          "items": [
